# Web dropdowns

Use `Select` from `@/components/select` (re-exported from `@/components/dashboard-ui`). Do not add native `<select>` elements.

- Match field styling with `className={fieldClass}` when the control sits with other form fields.
- Put the placeholder on the trigger only; do not add a placeholder row in `options`.
- Use `sortLabels` only when the list should be A–Z (county names). Leave catalog/admin option order as the caller provides.
- The hidden native `<select>` inside `select.tsx` is the only allowed HTML select (form submit / `required`).
